---
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
import Mechanism from '../components/Mechanism.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="The Warm Market Activation Method | NARA Studio"
  description="Start with the people already closest to buying. NARA maps the immediate market, activates trust, proves response and builds the founder brand from that evidence."
  path="/method"
>
  <main id="main">
    <header class="page-hero">
      <div class="shell stack">
        <span class="eyebrow">{site.mechanism}</span>
        <h1>Start with the people already closest to buying.</h1>
        <p class="lede muted">
          Personal branding becomes commercially useful when it creates a measurable path from recognition to conversation to revenue.
        </p>
        <p class="measure">NARA Studio builds that path from the market backwards.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="shell contrast-grid">
        <article class="contrast-card old">
          <b>The old sequence</b>
          <h2>Post → wait → chase reach → guess what worked</h2>
          <p>This creates a large volume of weak signals and very little commercial learning.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="contrast-card">
          <b>The NARA sequence</b>
          <h2>Map → activate → prove → build → repeat</h2>
          <p>The immediate market gives faster feedback than a cold audience. It shows what people care about, which proof earns trust and what reason is strong enough to act on now.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="shell method-layout">
        <Mechanism />
        <div class="stack">
          <span class="eyebrow">The system</span>
          <h2>Immediate market to revenue, then back into the brand.</h2>
          <p class="muted">
            The base is widest because the existing market is the foundation: current database, customers, followers, engagers, referrals, prior buyers and Top 100 Dream Prospects.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="shell split">
        <div class="kicker">
          <span class="eyebrow">01 · Map</span>
          <h2>Build the immediate serviceable market.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="stack">
          <p>
            We bring the current database, customers, referrals, followers, engagers, inbox history and Top 100 Dream Prospects into one view.
          </p>
          <p class="muted">Each person or account is grouped by fit, relationship strength, timing, proof angle and next action.</p>
          <p><strong>Output:</strong> a client-approved Warm Market Map and activation order.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="shell split">
        <div class="kicker">
          <span class="eyebrow">02 · Activate</span>
          <h2>Give the right people a relevant reason to respond.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="stack">
          <p>
            Activation can include database reactivation, warm reconnection, direct messages, thoughtful comments, targeted email, LinkedIn and account-based creative.
          </p>
          <p class="muted">The goal is not volume for its own sake. The goal is commercially useful response.</p>
          <p><strong>Output:</strong> qualified conversations, referrals, intent signals and live objections.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="shell split">
        <div class="kicker">
          <span class="eyebrow">03 · Prove</span>
          <h2>Connect attention to a commercial event.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="stack">
          <p>We track the path from source to reply, call, donation, opportunity and collected revenue.</p>
          <p>The scoreboard focuses on:</p>
          <ul class="list">
            <li>market coverage;</li>
            <li>response rate;</li>
            <li>qualified conversations;</li>
            <li>booked and held calls;</li>
            <li>opportunities;</li>
            <li>revenue; and</li>
            <li>the conversion point blocking growth.</li>
          </ul>
          <p><strong>Output:</strong> evidence of what is working and where the process breaks.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="shell split">
        <div class="kicker">
          <span class="eyebrow">04 · Build</span>
          <h2>Turn market evidence into the public brand.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="stack">
          <p>
            The founder’s positioning, proof, case studies, content pillars and campaign ideas are built from what the market has already responded to.
          </p>
          <p class="muted">
            This creates a personal brand with a commercial job: make the next conversation easier to start and easier to close.
          </p>
          <p><strong>Output:</strong> a sharper point of view, stronger proof and content tied to live demand.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="shell stack">
        <span class="eyebrow">The compounding loop</span>
        <h2>Proof sharpens the brand.</h2>
        <p class="lede muted">
          Every new conversation improves the message. Every stronger message improves the content. Every better asset improves activation. Every commercial outcome creates more proof.
        </p>
        <div class="actions">
          <Button href="/apply" event="primary_cta_click" meta="method">{site.primaryCta}</Button>
          <Button href="/apply" variant="secondary" event="secondary_cta_click" meta="method-fit">See If It Fits</Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <CtaBand
      title="Start with the trust you already have."
      body="If the market is sitting in a CRM, inbox, follower list or referral graph, NARA can map the fastest commercial starting point."
    />
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
